# Where the Marvel Rivals catalog comes from

Everything here was read on **2026-10-10** (fact-checked the same day by a
second pass). `catalog.json` is the two-kind form (`kinds`: Heroes, then their
Attacks; `../README.md`), Rainbow Six Siege's shape (D125): the owner picks the
hero, then that hero's own attacks. The carried kind is `attacks`, so the app
says "attack", not "gun". The catalog carries `review` (D132): it stays held
until the owner approves it.

**Pictures: none.** Every `image` is `null` (no official artwork fetched this
round). A picture added later must come from NetEase's own hosts.

