## The attacks

Each hero's `loadout.attacks` is the primary (left-click) attack, plus, for
some heroes, a second attack: another form's primary (where the HUD swaps the
ability row or the ammo counter) or a second weapon on its own button: Hulk
(Gamma Ray Gun as Bruce Banner, Heavy Blow as Hero and Monster Hulk), Black
Widow (Red Room Rifle, Electric Batons; reworked in Season 9), Hawkeye
(Piercing and Blast Arrow), Iron Man (Repulsor Blast, Unibeam on right
click), The Punisher (Adjudication, Deliverance), Cloak & Dagger (Lightforce
Dagger, Darkforce Cloak), Rocket Raccoon (Bombard and Repair Mode), Emma
Frost (Telepathic Pulse, Faceted Fury in Diamond Form), Blade (Ancestral
Sword, Hunter's Shotgun), Angela (Spear and Axes of Ichors), Gambit (Kinetic
Cards, Bayou Bash on right click), Deadpool (Dual Desert Eagles, Kick@$$
Katanas), Elsa Bloodstone (Double-Barrel Blaster, Monster-Piercer), White Fox
(Yeowoo Guseul, Claw Strike while Awakened, Ninefold Slam in Kumiho Form),
Cyclops (Optic Blast, Concussive Beam on right click), The Hood (Accursed
Pistols, Leaded Transformation: his Half-Demon State, rifles in place of
pistols).

Checked this pass against [rivalsmeta's hero pages](https://rivalsmeta.com/characters/)
(each item's second source): every name in the catalog for Angela, Black Cat,
Black Widow, Cloak & Dagger, Cyclops, Daredevil, Devil Dinosaur, Elsa
